      "content": "managing it sounds so exhausting though. i'm just so worn down. it's like everyone tells me to keep fighting, but they don't see that the cost of staying in this fight is just... everything. i don't see how anything ever actually changes. it just feels like i'm running in circles until i eventually break.",
